<h1>full array</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A term from combinatorial chemistry referring to trying all possible combinations of blocks.  This is <em>not</em> a data structure, and is here to reduce confusion.
</p>


<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>
<h2>More information</h2>
<p>
<strong>Dimitris K. Agrafiotis</strong>, <em>Multiobjective Optimization of Combinatorial Libraries</em>, IBM Journal of Research and Development, Yorktown Heights, New York, USA, 45(3/4):545-566, May/July 2001.  Referenced on page 548.
</p>

